    Keep vphoned bounded over days of IcliKit calls
    
    icli 0.7.11 stops leaking a display-sized image on every screen
    capture, adds the NaN/non-UTF-8 JSON guards to the rest of its
    helpers, and makes run-loop waits safe on worker threads without a
    run loop, which is how vphoned calls it.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

